  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [babel-eslint](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint) from `v8.0.1` to `v8.0.2`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>babel/babel-eslint</summary>\n\n#### 8.0.2\n-   [`a0fbd50`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/a0fbd503d89fbaddca0aea0bcd277812df17a97d) 8.0.2\n-   [`2004b91`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/2004b913c7abef8d21cebca7f3ae39a9deaee767) require correct deps\n-   [`fa56d21`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/fa56d21f3e9acd023fc4610ca36666e3a3078bbb) Always use unpad (#&#8203;535)\n-   [`295091d`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/295091df9146a725abd69e43c7863aa4741853c3) Allow ^ version for babel dependencies (#&#8203;534)\n-   [`d3b8519`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/d3b8519d935dbc4e6bf538548c0002afde916603) fix(package): update babylon to version 7.0.0-beta.31 (#&#8203;533)\n-   [`54ab4ac`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/54ab4ac772364b2742aafb9a2549d81a57bd42a5) 8.0.1\n-   [`c1a7882`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/c1a78824688425f12687e79124fc847d484034eb) Update README.md support (#&#8203;531) [skip ci]\n-   [`51100c9`](https://github.com/babel/babel-eslint/commit/51100c960ae151989d4eea1ec52d2ef5a2f5a2de) chore(package): update mocha to version 4.0.0 (#&#8203;524)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
